Did all 3 fail at the same time? I know that ours didn't like some
brands of tape
The possible errors are
ERR MAG - inconsistent number of tapes in drive
ERR LDR - loader error
ERR DRV - drive error (tape)
ERR CTL - controller error
ERR UNK - unknown
If the error doesn't clear by load/unload, head cleaning or power
off/on
then it's time for a service call. There is a user guide in Slovenia?
http://www.xenya.si/sup/info/digital/MDS/jun99/Cd3/STORAGE/SM1TGUGB.PDF
Phil



